  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### How to include late claims in a VAT Return?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 22 Dec, 2021 at  3:42 PM\n\n\t\tLocation:\n\nBookkeeping > Select Client > MTD > Submit VAT return > Enter VAT period\n\n> click 'Include' > Search for the transaction > Select and click 'Include'\n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\nHow to include late claims in a VAT Return\n\nHelp guide:\n\nOnce the VAT return has been created. You can add any late claims into the current years return. \n\nTo do so, go into the 'Include / Exclude Transaction' section of the return and click on 'Include'.\n\nYou can search for the late claim transaction by searching for the dates. \n\nSelect the transaction and click on 'Include' \n\nYou will then see the selected transactions on the VAT return. \n\nThen click on include as highlighted above.\n\nThis will take you to the next page of the VAT return where you can continue to process the return.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188520\">Bookkeeping FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to include late claims in a VAT Return?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 22 Dec, 2021 at  3:42 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><u>Location:</u></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Bookkeeping &gt; Select Client &gt; MTD &gt; Submit VAT return &gt; Enter VAT period</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&gt;&nbsp;click 'Include' &gt; Search for the transaction &gt; Select and click 'Include'</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><u>Video Tutorial:</u></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;